:0},{"category":"Venues & Event Spaces","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Cocktail Bars","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"Nightlife","historical_business_count":5}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Mexican, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"9zlspOuU7cXAVesgah7udA","review_id":"8BU3h9lzyuomh9TvMgvM6Q","date":"2018-03-24T22:51:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9399634599685669,"text_excerpt":"I really liked this place. We were lucky enough to arrive while it was still 'Happy Hour'. Many of the menu items were half price. Score! Of course we ordered a bunch of different apps for the table. The tortilla chips and salsa are housemade. It was so good that we ordered a second. I especially liked the elote (street corn). I actually can't wait to go back and get it again! Order one for yourself. You'll thank me later! Both the brisket and chicken tacos were good. The tacos are small, so you will want to order a few if you're hungry. You can't go wrong for $2.50 each! We also tried the papas bravas, which were also great. Our server was very nice and attentive. He was able to answer a..."},{"business_id":"9zlspOuU7cXAVesgah7udA","review_id":"pG6SSF-Jdt9H7BYyjYWD6w","date":"2017-12-24T03:41:07","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.93455970287323,"text_excerpt":"We had a great first experience at El Patio; especially after the success and disappoint of La Casita closing its downtown location. They have a great spot with a beautiful patio that I can't wait to enjoy in the warmer months. We came during happy hour hoping to indulge in some margaritas and tacos. We were surprised by how \"grown up\" the menu was. We tried the queso ( as good as always with and upgraded chip!), al pastor, albondigas, carne asada and the churro sandwich. It was all delicious! The churro really stood out to me, bringing back Disneyland memories. Another surprise was the garlic collards on the steak, my southern other half wanted bacon added, but my Cali self enjoyed the f..."},{"business_id":"9zlspOuU7cXAVesgah7udA","review_id":"xuq1chHH2ppo39nPokS9lA","date":"2018-06-09T02:56:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9320437908172607,"text_excerpt":"What a cute place! We decided to try this restaurant since they have happy hour tacos and drinks from 3:00-7:00 DAILY. The tacos were tasty, chicken was my favorite. We also ordered trio dip and chips which was perfect for a table of 4. By 7 pm the patio was shady so we moved to the patio which also had fans and corn hole. The service was great but no table service, you order everything at the bar, get a number; and it's brought to you. I really enjoyed this casual but chic restaurant and will be back! Highly recommended for a later daily happy hour special"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"9zlspOuU7cXAVesgah7udA","photo_id":"N2OO4Xj48sxx4bDJ8mpJBg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/N2OO4Xj48sxx4bDJ8mpJBg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9349408745765686},{"business_id":"9zlspOuU7cXAVesgah7udA","photo_id":"LwasT5cUnR3NT8A8VlRoqQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LwasT5cUnR3NT8A8VlRoqQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8641490936279297},{"business_id":"9zlspOuU7cXAVesgah7udA","photo_id":"hHi_gHNh4zIA6T55-iDMvg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/hHi_gHNh4zIA6T55-iDMvg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8601160049438477},{"business_id":"9zlspOuU7cXAVesgah7udA","photo_id":"Vzg8glz_Hs4Ai8sAe56KCA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Vzg8glz_Hs4Ai8sAe56KCA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8171682357788086},{"business_id":"9zlspOuU7cXAVesgah7udA","photo_id":"HINjcVY_PJFXP_v-3RCDMA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/HINjcVY_PJFXP_v-3RCDMA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8034269213676453}]},"notebook_case":null}
